{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An actor who stands where the author put him is scenery with a name on it. Four","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"factories here cover the behaviors that make one feel like a person in the room:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"he moves around a set of rooms on his own, he keeps up with the player, he takes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"things, and he has something to say when spoken to.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors"},{"text":" is a ","type":"text"},{"code":"GamePlugin","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which here means it owns nothing at all —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"no entities, no "},{"code":"@Global","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", no saved state. An actor’s position ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"is"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" his","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"placement, which the engine already saves. So the plugin is never listed in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"content"},{"type":"text","text":"; it is stored as a plain property, and the host splices the return"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"values into its own blocks. The three daemon factories return a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TimedEvent"},{"text":" for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the ","type":"text"},{"code":"timers","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" block; ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/reaction(of:for:reply:)"},{"text":" returns ","type":"text"},{"code":"Rules","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the ","type":"text"},{"code":"rules","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" block. Everything they act on — the actor, the room set, the loot,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the prose — is handed in by the host.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Randomness is drawn only after a factory’s guards pass. A roaming daemon whose","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"actor is out of position, or a thief whose player has nothing worth taking,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"consumes no randomness at all, so a seeded transcript that never meets the actor","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stays stable no matter what he gets up to elsewhere. ","type":"text"},{"code":"when:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/roams(_:named:rooms:chancePerTurn:when:arrival:departure:)"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/follows(_:named:rooms:when:arrivals:)"},{"text":" is evaluated","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"before the position guard for the same reason: a shut gate is a quiet, draw-free","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"turn.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"None of these daemons acts for an actor whose ","type":"text"},{"code":"Actor.isUnconscious","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is set. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"man lying on the floor does not wander off, catch you up, or lift anything out of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"your hands, and he draws no randomness deciding not to. The flag is the engine’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rather than this plugin’s because what usually puts a villain down is a combat","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"plugin, and two plugins cannot see each other: ","type":"text"},{"code":"GnustoMeleeCombat","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" sets it and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this one reads it, with neither library knowing the other exists.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Wiring","type":"heading","text":"Wiring","level":2},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Gnusto","import GnustoActors","","struct Gallery: Game {","    let title = \"Gallery\"","    let actors = ActorBehaviors()","","    let thief = Actor { name(\"shadowy figure\"); synonyms(\"thief\", \"figure\") }","    let painting = Item { name(\"oil painting\"); adjectives(\"oil\") }","    let cellar = Location { name(\"Cellar\"); description(\"…\") }","    let studio = Location { name(\"Studio\"); description(\"…\") }","","    var timers: [TimedEvent] {","        actors.roams(","            thief,","            named: \"thief.roam\",","            rooms: [cellar, studio],","            chancePerTurn: 50,","            arrival: \"A shadow detaches itself from the doorway.\",","            departure: \"The shadow is somewhere else, and you did not see it go.\")","        actors.steals(","            thief,","            named: \"thief.steal\",","            candidates: [painting],","            chancePerTurn: 30,","            announcement: .naming { \"A hand you never see relieves you of \\($0).\" })","    }","","    var rules: Rules {","        actors.reaction(of: thief, for: [.give, .attack], reply: \"The figure is not there when you reach it.\")","    }","","    var map: WorldMap { … }","}"]},{"anchor":"Roaming-and-following-are-different-daemons","type":"heading","text":"Roaming and following are different daemons","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/roams(_:named:rooms:chancePerTurn:when:arrival:departure:)"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"teleports the actor within a room set, with no exit-graph awareness — a wall","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"between two rooms in the set will not stop him. It has both an ","type":"text"},{"code":"arrival","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"departure","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" line, because the player can be standing in either room.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/follows(_:named:rooms:when:arrivals:)"},{"text":" moves the actor to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wherever the player now stands. Daemons tick at the end of the turn, after ","type":"text"},{"code":"go","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"has resolved and the new room has been described, so the companion catches up on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the same turn and his arrival line trails the room description. There is no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"departure","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" line, because he only ever moves ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"toward"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" the player and nobody is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"left behind to watch him go. He draws no randomness whatever: ","type":"text"},{"code":"arrivals","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cycled by the saved turn counter, so the line varies from arrival to arrival and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stays identical across a save and restore. Pass one line for a fixed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"announcement, or a dozen so a constant companion does not wear his welcome out.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Both prose channels are gated on light. In the dark, or a room away, the movement","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is silent.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Two ways to scope a follower, and they scope different things. ","type":"text"},{"code":"rooms:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whitelist of ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"destinations"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" — a gaoler who walks the corridors and will not set","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"foot in a cell follows you along the one and lets you go into the other, which is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"what makes “somewhere he will not go” a place you can stand. ","type":"text"},{"code":"when:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"gate, for the companion who has been told to wait. ","type":"text"},{"code":"stopDaemon(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" parks him","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"where he stands and ","type":"text"},{"code":"startDaemon(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" picks him up again; ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sources\/KindlyDeep\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"turns its whole endgame on which room the mule was standing in when he was","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"parked.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Start a follower co-located with the player and there is no spurious arrival on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"turn one.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"The-thief-takes-from-anywhere-in-the-room","type":"heading","text":"The thief takes from anywhere in the room","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/steals(_:named:candidates:chancePerTurn:announcement:)"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"lifts a candidate from wherever it lies in the shared room: out of the player’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"hands, off the floor, or from inside anything open, to any depth. Only another","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"actor’s hands are out of reach. The theft is announced only when the room is lit;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in the dark you find out when you check your pockets.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Worked-examples","type":"heading","text":"Worked examples","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Sources\/Lighthouse\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" has a keeper who roams two rooms stacked on a staircase.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sources\/KindlyDeep\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" has the follow-park-rejoin cycle in full, and its design","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doc (","type":"text"},{"code":"docs\/games\/kindly-deep.md","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") is where the reasoning lives.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sources\/Zork1\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" runs the thief: roaming the whole underground, stealing from the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"treasure roster, and fighting back only in his own lair.","type":"text"}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"GnustoActors"}],"roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection","externalID":"GnustoActors","title":"GnustoActors","symbolKind":"module"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Daemons that make an NPC wander, tag along, or go through your pockets."}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"The-plugin","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors","doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/init()"],"title":"The plugin"},{"anchor":"Moving-an-actor","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/roams(_:named:rooms:chancePerTurn:when:arrival:departure:)","doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/follows(_:named:rooms:when:arrivals:)"],"title":"Moving an actor"},{"anchor":"Taking-things","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/steals(_:named:candidates:chancePerTurn:announcement:)"],"title":"Taking things"},{"anchor":"Answering-the-player","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/reaction(of:for:reply:)"],"title":"Answering the player"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustoactors"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"references":{"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors":{"title":"GnustoActors","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Daemons that make an NPC wander, tag along, or go through your pockets."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"collection"},"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors/ActorBehaviors/roams(_:named:rooms:chancePerTurn:when:arrival:departure:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors\/roams(_:named:rooms:chanceperturn:when:arrival:departure:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"roams","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV","text":"Actor","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"named","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"text":"rooms","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8LocationV","text":"Location","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"], "},{"text":"chancePerTurn","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"when"},{"kind":"text","text":": () -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"arrival"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"departure"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":"?) -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"TimedEvent","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A daemon that, with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"chancePerTurn"},{"text":", moves ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"actor"},{"text":" to a random","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"other"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" room in ","type":"text"},{"code":"rooms","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — a teleport within the set, with no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"exit-graph awareness (a wall between two rooms in the set won’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stop him). Arrival\/departure lines print only when the player’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"room is lit and is the room being entered or left: in the dark, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a room away, movement is silent. The daemon idles (no RNG drawn)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"while the actor is outside ","type":"text"},{"code":"rooms","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — including after ","type":"text"},{"code":"vanish()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"but the host should still ","type":"text"},{"code":"stopDaemon(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on the actor’s death.","type":"text"}],"title":"roams(_:named:rooms:chancePerTurn:when:arrival:departure:)","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/roams(_:named:rooms:chancePerTurn:when:arrival:departure:)","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors/ActorBehaviors/reaction(of:for:reply:)":{"title":"reaction(of:for:reply:)","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors\/reaction(of:for:reply:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/reaction(of:for:reply:)","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"reaction"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"of"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV","text":"Actor"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"for"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto6IntentV","text":"Intent"},{"text":"], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"reply","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5RulesV","text":"Rules"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A canned reply when any of the named intents target the actor —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“talk to troll”, “give sword to troll”, whatever the host’s verbs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"emit. One line, before-phase, ends the turn."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors/ActorBehaviors":{"title":"ActorBehaviors","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ActorBehaviors"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ActorBehaviors"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Logic-only NPC behaviors: roaming, theft, canned reactions. The plugin","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"owns no entities and no state — position "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"is"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" the actor’s placement —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so the host declares its actors and splices these factories into its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"own "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"timers"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rules"},{"type":"text","text":" blocks:"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors/ActorBehaviors/follows(_:named:rooms:when:arrivals:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors\/follows(_:named:rooms:when:arrivals:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"follows","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Actor","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"named","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rooms","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Location","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8LocationV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]?, ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"when"},{"kind":"text","text":": () -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"arrivals"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"]) -> "},{"text":"TimedEvent","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A daemon that keeps "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"actor"},{"type":"text","text":" in the player’s room: each turn, if the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"actor is onstage but elsewhere, it teleports to wherever the player","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"now stands. Daemons tick at the end of the turn, after the player’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"go"},{"text":" has resolved and the new room is described, so the companion","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"catches up the same turn and its ","type":"text"},{"code":"arrival","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" line trails the room","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"description. The line prints only when the destination is lit: in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"the dark the companion arrives unseen. There is deliberately no"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"departure","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" line — the companion only ever moves "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"to"}]},{"text":" the player,","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so no one is ever in the room it leaves to watch it go (unlike"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"roams","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"). The daemon idles while the actor is offstage — including"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"after "},{"code":"vanish()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — and the host may "},{"code":"stopDaemon(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to park the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"companion for a “wait here” beat, then "},{"code":"startDaemon(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to resume."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It draws no randomness at all (unlike "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"roams"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"steals","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"following companion never perturbs the seeded stream: "},{"code":"arrivals","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cycled by the saved turn counter, so the line varies from arrival to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"arrival yet stays deterministic across save and restore. Pass one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"line for a fixed announcement, a dozen so a constant companion does"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not wear his welcome out. Start the companion co-located with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"player ("},{"code":"starts(in:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" the player’s start room) to avoid a spurious"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"arrival on turn one."}],"title":"follows(_:named:rooms:when:arrivals:)","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/follows(_:named:rooms:when:arrivals:)","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors/ActorBehaviors/init()":{"title":"init()","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors\/init()","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/init()","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"()"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates the plugin."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors/ActorBehaviors/steals(_:named:candidates:chancePerTurn:announcement:)":{"title":"steals(_:named:candidates:chancePerTurn:announcement:)","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors\/steals(_:named:candidates:chanceperturn:announcement:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/steals(_:named:candidates:chancePerTurn:announcement:)","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"steals","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Actor","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"named","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"candidates","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Item","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto4ItemV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"chancePerTurn","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"announcement","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GameText","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Line","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV4LineV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"GameText","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV4NounV","text":"Noun","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">) -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV","text":"TimedEvent","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A daemon that, when ","type":"text"},{"code":"actor","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" shares the player’s room, rolls","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"chancePerTurn","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and moves one random ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"reachable","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" item from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"candidates"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"into the actor’s inventory, announcing it with the stolen item’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rendered name — “the silver chalice”, “Ozymandias” — so the line writes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no article of its own."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Like the original’s thief, the actor lifts a candidate from wherever it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lies in the shared room: out of the player’s hands, off the floor, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from inside anything open — a sack, a trophy case, a table top — to any"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"depth. Only another actor’s hands are beyond reach. The theft is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"announced only when the player’s room is lit: in the dark you find out"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when you check your pockets."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"}}}